      "summary": "Mirrored the completed decoder TP track onto the Mamba-3 megakernel. EDIT M: added the Megatron shard table + scalar (non-wgmma) row-parallel/col-parallel partial helpers + sym-heap sizing to model_stage_mamba_tc.cuh. EDIT M-D: added mb_forward_sample_tp / mb_backward_sample_tp <Par,Transport> with the 4 if-constexpr(Par::kTPComm) reduce points (out_proj + down forward all-reduce; in_proj + gate/up dX backward all-reduce), reusing tp_transport.cuh's fixed-order ascending-pe reduce; split mb_mixer_fwd/_swiglu_fwd into shared _pre helpers so the SSM body stays byte-identical. EDIT M-C: templated fused_mamba_megakernel_tc<Opt,Par=SingleGPU> + trailing CommCtx, and restructured P1 to grid-lockstep-over-SAMPLES on the kTPComm path (the decoder's §1 deadlock fix adapted to Mamba's batch-parallel scalar loop). EDIT M-E: nvshmem_malloc symmetric tp_sym_heap + mb_tc_ensure_tp_sym_heap + CommCtx population + {1,8} TP dispatch (all #if SG_HAS_NVSHMEM). Reused the SHARED tp_transport.cuh/parallel_config.cuh; the decoder's wgmma-tile tp_layer.cuh does not apply to the scan-dominated scalar Mamba path. Attention head-shard scoped out (Mamba has no attention); SSM body replicated, projection recombination boundaries sharded. SingleGPU byte-identical (Par=SingleGPU folds every kTPComm branch); gfx942/tpu untouched. All 3 gates pass (pytest unchanged from baseline, default TC compile OK, NVSHMEM RDC compile OK). Committed 5e084ca."
